rc=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230207/699679267222982656214975.jpeg/T8mfXtPsusDpZ7_uqOVcdznKtN8C7vtO_HAz4vxwM-I\"/><figcaption>電競女選手甜甜珂（微博/甜甜珂）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電競女選手甜甜珂（微博/甜甜珂）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230207/699679269475454976437690.jpeg/_9hKegzlT6XpKPNzHlYYodJjcwtIyjG683rsW_N67Fs\"/><figcaption>電競女選手甜甜珂（微博/甜甜珂）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電競女選手甜甜珂（微博/甜甜珂）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230207/699679276157374464914680.jpeg/ExwBw-5iYRFJldn2qwzWHGsQD3wRtTMSqVy-MKlcvjA\"/><figcaption>電競女選手甜甜珂（微博/甜甜珂）</figcaption></figure><p>餐廳點餐、收碗盤全靠自己 他收拾完見1幕氣炸：誰才是店員？</p><p>不是香水！辦公室「人手一罐」超常見 網爆共鳴：大人的世界</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:53.982333+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1474,"images":33,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:30:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:33.456860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:27.909044+00:00","content_hash":"b52d01853b6c81916452f2251affe77666f934552c838b82a1a2e48c345daee1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}